Starting today, new and qualifying returning subscribers can <a href="https://offers.appleone.apple/en-us/new-device-offer">get a free three-month Apple One trial</a> with the purchase of any new iPhone, iPad, or Mac capable of running the latest iOS, iPadOS, or macOS versions from Apple or an Apple Authorized Reseller.<br/>
<br/>
<img src="https://images.macrumors.com/article-new/2026/09/Apple-One-on-Gradient.jpg" alt="" width="2500" height="1406" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-1065842" /><br/>
For the three-month trial, you can choose from any of the available plans: Apple One Individual (normally &#36;21.95 per month in the U.S.), Apple One Family (normally &#36;27.95 per month), or Apple One Premier (normally &#36;39.95 per month). After the trial ends, you will be automatically billed at the full price unless/until you cancel.<br/>
<br/>
Here's what each plan includes:<ul><br/>
  <li><strong>Individual:</strong> 50GB of iCloud+ storage, Apple TV, Apple Music, and Apple Arcade</li><br/>
  <li><strong>Family:</strong> 200GB of iCloud+ storage, Apple TV, Apple Music, and Apple Arcade</li><br/>
  <li><strong>Premier:</strong> 2TB of iCloud+ storage, Apple TV, Apple Music, Apple Arcade, Apple Fitness+, and Apple News+</li><br/>
</ul><br/>
<br/>
Apple says the offer is not available to current Apple One subscribers, or to previous Apple One subscribers who cancelled within the last 60 days. There are some other strings attached, so visit the <a href="https://offers.appleone.apple/en-us/new-device-offer">offer page</a> and review Apple's <a href="https://www.apple.com/promo/pdf/Apple_One_Bundle_Offer_TCs.pdf">terms and conditions</a>.<br/>
<br/>
Apple's steps to initiate the trial:<ul><br/>
  <li>Turn on your new iPhone, iPad, or Mac and sign in with your Apple Account.</li><br/>
  <li>Make sure the device is running the latest version of iOS, iPadOS, or macOS.</li><br/>
  <li>Open the Settings app and look for "Services included with your purchase" to complete setup.</li><br/>
</ul>If you cancel the trial, Apple says it ends immediately.<br/>
